tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503180/extras/e76d73f551fd9af5e355429f91088cb5.mp4?t=1740406858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features Include:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outrun the Mummies:</strong>\u00a0Fast-paced gameplay keeps the action moving and the stakes high.\u00a0 Run away from mummies to avoid damage, or stand still to charge your camera and feel your heart racing as  enemies close the gap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart the Mummies:</strong>\u00a0Master your environment to trap or destroy the mummies pursuing you. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Mechanics:</strong>\u00a0New enemies and traps are introduced every few levels to keep the gameplay fresh all the way to the end.<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Characters:</strong>\u00a0From a rollerblader to a drone operator, find and unlock new characters with unique abilities, movement, and cameras.<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loads of Content:</strong> We made this game bigger than we should have - there are 112 levels, each of which takes 2-5 minutes.\u00a0 Expect over 20 hours of gameplay to enjoy your first time through!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Modes:</strong> Elevate your heart rate with a time attack mode, or layer on incrementally hard difficulty options that fundamentally change the way you interact with the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take it Easy:</strong>\u00a0For those who want a more scenic experience, there are a several options for bringing the difficulty down dramatically.\u00a0 Play at your own pace!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503180/extras/c35e44093d85647bf38fa7702357fd36.poster.avif?t=1740406858\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503180/extras/c35e44093d85647bf38fa7702357fd36.webm?t=1740406858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503180/extras/c35e44093d85647bf38fa7702357fd36.mp4?t=1740406858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the entire campaign solo, or grab some friends to play together! Up to 4 players can play the entire game locally, or remotely using Steam Remote Play. Embrace the chaos of escaping mummies as a full tour group, and laugh at your friends as they run into traps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503180/extras/b3b4da0a2b4fbc516c18131fe8506ab8.poster.avif?t=1740406858\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503180/extras/b3b4da0a2b4fbc516c18131fe8506ab8.webm?t=1740406858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503180/extras/b3b4da0a2b4fbc516c18131fe8506ab8.mp4?t=1740406858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>",
